    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638650/extras/1f27a027f58c9987be8c955736be08db.poster.avif?t=1753902099\" width=532 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638650/extras/1f27a027f58c9987be8c955736be08db.webm?t=1753902099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638650/extras/1f27a027f58c9987be8c955736be08db.mp4?t=1753902099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What if your internship interview turned into a fight for your sanity?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a surreal experience that fuses soulslike gameplay with roguelike elements, where every workday is a battle for survival. Play as Alex, a recent graduate desperate to escape unemployment, who finally secures a position at a powerful tech corporation after months of tireless applications. But on his first day, he's dragged into a dark alternate reality, where the office twists into a nightmarish labyrinth and its workers have become mindless drones, enslaved by the company\u2019s unseen agenda.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638650/extras/0e286836377e56e1c5423ae52c4d6c66.poster.avif?t=1753902099\" width=533 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638650/extras/0e286836377e56e1c5423ae52c4d6c66.webm?t=1753902099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight Back with Your Mind and Reflexes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To escape, Alex must battle through ever-shifting levels in fast-paced, stamina-free combat. Dodge, parry, and counter in real time while strategically balancing healing, defense, and special abilities to survive the psychological chaos of the corporate nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638650/extras/eaf849fde4d01fb419c50a752ba63f28.poster.avif?t=1753902099\" width=533 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638650/extras/eaf849fde4d01fb419c50a752ba63f28.webm?t=1753902099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Loot the Office, Upgrade Your Sanity</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scour hidden vaults filled with rare loot and upgrades that permanently enhance your combat style. Discover unpredictable shopkeepers offering powerful weapons, stat boosts, and consumables to help you adapt to each floor\u2019s evolving threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638650/extras/ea7379c475ddf27330431989574ff2ad.poster.avif?t=1753902099\" width=533 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638650/extras/ea7379c475ddf27330431989574ff2ad.webm?t=1753902099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Face the Bosses of Corporate Madness</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each department ends with a grotesque boss fight, twisted avatars of toxic workplace culture. Learn their patterns, overcome their mechanics, and expose the secrets buried deep within the company\u2019s corrupted core.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638650/extras/16b78fd86a4c2a2697ab74d5204a9647.poster.avif?t=1753902099\" width=533 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638650/extras/16b78fd86a4c2a2697ab74d5204a9647.webm?t=1753902099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Beat the Clock, Break the Cycle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware at 5 PM, everything resets. The office reboots, the layout changes, and the nightmare begins again at 9 AM. Can Alex break the loop and uncover the truth, or will he be stuck in the system forever?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638650/extras/1f27a027f58c9987be8c955736be08db.poster.avif?t=1753902099\" width=532 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638650/extras/1f27a027f58c9987be8c955736be08db.webm?t=1753902099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638650/extras/1f27a027f58c9987be8c955736be08db.mp4?t=1753902099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What if your internship interview turned into a fight for your sanity?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a surreal experience that fuses soulslike gameplay with roguelike elements, where every workday is a battle for survival. Play as Alex, a recent graduate desperate to escape unemployment, who finally secures a position at a powerful tech corporation after months of tireless applications. But on his first day, he's dragged into a dark alternate reality, where the office twists into a nightmarish labyrinth and its workers have become mindless drones, enslaved by the company\u2019s unseen agenda.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638650/extras/0e286836377e56e1c5423ae52c4d6c66.poster.avif?t=1753902099\" width=533 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638650/extras/0e286836377e56e1c5423ae52c4d6c66.webm?t=1753902099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight Back with Your Mind and Reflexes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To escape, Alex must battle through ever-shifting levels in fast-paced, stamina-free combat. Dodge, parry, and counter in real time while strategically balancing healing, defense, and special abilities to survive the psychological chaos of the corporate nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638650/extras/eaf849fde4d01fb419c50a752ba63f28.poster.avif?t=1753902099\" width=533 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638650/extras/eaf849fde4d01fb419c50a752ba63f28.webm?t=1753902099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Loot the Office, Upgrade Your Sanity</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scour hidden vaults filled with rare loot and upgrades that permanently enhance your combat style. Discover unpredictable shopkeepers offering powerful weapons, stat boosts, and consumables to help you adapt to each floor\u2019s evolving threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638650/extras/ea7379c475ddf27330431989574ff2ad.poster.avif?t=1753902099\" width=533 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638650/extras/ea7379c475ddf27330431989574ff2ad.webm?t=1753902099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Face the Bosses of Corporate Madness</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each department ends with a grotesque boss fight, twisted avatars of toxic workplace culture. Learn their patterns, overcome their mechanics, and expose the secrets buried deep within the company\u2019s corrupted core.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638650/extras/16b78fd86a4c2a2697ab74d5204a9647.poster.avif?t=1753902099\" width=533 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638650/extras/16b78fd86a4c2a2697ab74d5204a9647.webm?t=1753902099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Beat the Clock, Break the Cycle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware at 5 PM, everything resets. The office reboots, the layout changes, and the nightmare begins again at 9 AM. Can Alex break the loop and uncover the truth, or will he be stuck in the system forever?</p>",
    "short_description": "The Internal is a roguelike souls game where you play as Alex, a recent grad who finally lands a job, only to discover the office is a nightmare labyrinth and coworkers are drone-like husks. Climb the corporate ladder or die trying in a world where HR stands for \u201cHorrific Reality.\u201d",
